tic Minority Oversampling Technique), which resulted in the equal distribution of both the classes (0 and 1). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":234266,"global_rank":95618,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16791},{"name":"qaz6209031/CalPass","owner":"qaz6209031","html_url":"https://github.com/qaz6209031/CalPass","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Cal Poly Personal Assistant","topics":[],"score":234254,"global_rank":95632,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16792},{"name":"qsweber/radio-export","owner":"qsweber","html_url":"https://github.com/qsweber/radio-export","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"Scrapes playlists from my favorite radio stations and converts them to Spotify playlists","topics":[],"score":234245,"global_rank":95636,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16793},{"name":"SebastinSanty/PastebinDjango","owner":"SebastinSanty","html_url":"https://github.com/SebastinSanty/PastebinDjango","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":234245,"global_rank":95637,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16794},{"name":"brianwright2/isolation_forest","owner":"brianwright2","html_url":"https://github.com/brianwright2/isolation_forest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementation of isolation forest algorithm in Python","topics":[],"score":234243,"global_rank":